    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστρά̆τ-ευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without service</i>:
			hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>exempt therefrom,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				9.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>never having seen service,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.176
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ λιποτάκτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.144
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					1.159
				</span></i>
			.</div>
